Vendored from https://github.com/serezhka/java-airplay at 59816100c87212353a4191a922aa97226af2cccd (MIT): protocol/ and server/ sources, unchanged unless noted in README.

Changes for Android (pi-airplay):
- removed server/.../discovery/MdnsAdvertiser.java and server/.../AirPlayServer.java: JmDNS is
  replaced by Android's NsdManager in AirPlayService, which also builds the ControlServer itself
- protocol/.../pairing/PairingIdentity.java: added fromSeed() and seed(), to keep one identity
  across restarts
- server/.../handler/audio/AudioHandler.java: rewritten. The original waited forever for a lost
  UDP packet (common on Wi-Fi) and stopped at the 16-bit sequence wrap-around, silencing the sound;
  this one skips a missing packet after ~100 ms and handles the wrap
